  "intentional_semantic_differences": [
    "Date and DateTime reject impossible calendar rollover and require the reviewed ISO/RFC3339 shape.",
    "Decimal divide validates scale and mode even when the quotient is exact; exact finite quotients remain unrounded as in the reference property evaluator."
